          "label": "Communication and authority boundary",
          "guidance": "A status record reports verified file activity as of a stated time; it does not create coverage, waive requirements, promise payment, or replace an authorized decision notice. Separate facts, pending work, estimates, and final decisions and cite the controlling record."
        }
